                Check employee 101's leave balance. If they have at least 1 day of leave remaining, search hotels in Munnar. If they have no leave remaining, don't search for hotels
                
                Level 3 and basic Level 4 can be implemented using the same Spring AI + MCP + 
                ChatClient foundation. 
   The major difference is the degree of autonomous goal-oriented decision-making and orchestration. Prompting can enable some of that behavior, but a production Level-4 agent usually adds explicit state, planning, guardrails, approvals, retries, and step control
   
   Discover/use tools from multiple MCP servers.
Decide which tool to call.
Receive the tool result.
Use the result to decide whether another tool should be called.
Continue with another MCP tool.
Produce a final response.